review:
Another great game by Jet Dogs where we have brave heroines, vampires and mysterious prophecies. It all starts suddenly with a giant monster chasing after two lovers. They split at some point, leaving the woman whose name she doesn't know to look for her fiance in a town she doesn't know anything about. As she journeys on, she meets town locals and vampire guardians as well, she learns about vampires and how to deal with them, but nearly to the end she learns of her origin... 

PROS:
- Beautiful scenery;
- Environment music that chills;
- Interesting story;
- Unlimited hints;
- Different interface;
- Obtainable achievements;
- Trading cards.

CONS:
- When we choose a wrong item, the item doesn't return immediately to the inventory through the right click. It stays a while, if the inventory is not up;
- When collecting an item, the new one takes the first position in the inventory rather than the last position;
- No Bonus Chapter.

All in all, it was an interesting experience. If you like vampires as much as I do, get the game on discount. It is worth for a one night adventure.
